<title>USA: Tenafly, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Tenafly, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $2.240 million of Tenafly, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.50, highest price of 100.011.</p>
</text>
